# OpenBank Code Owners
#
# This file defines required reviewers for changes to specific paths.
# Used together with branch protection to enforce review on sensitive code.
#
# Order matters — last matching rule wins.
# Reference: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# As the project grows, additional maintainers will be added per area.
# Adding yourself to CODEOWNERS requires sustained, high-quality contributions
# in that area and approval from existing maintainers.

# Default — everything requires owner review
